  m_Name: Doll
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LetterData
  contentList:
  - I hope you're doing well.  I'm looking for a new doll to complete my family.
    May I ask you to bring one?
  - I hope you're having fun preparing Christmas!  I would love a new doll to join
    my little family. Could you please bring one? Thank you, Santa.
  - "I hope Mrs. Claus and the elves are doing well!  I\u2019m wishing for a tiny
    friend shaped like me, to join my imaginary world."
